# Historical benchmark archive

These four files preserve every line of the 5,752-line BENCHMARKS.md as it
stood before the 2026-10-15 consolidation. In filename order, their bytewise
concatenation has SHA-256
`6cf53334a6d2e46d66d60f4203607023e35320cc274ad9a456b58a23fb8f90d0`.
The original section headings, fixed acceptance gates, failed experiments,
trace excerpts and reproduction commands have not been rewritten. Later
measurements may supersede an early number; use the [living summary](../../../BENCHMARKS.md)
for current decisions.

| File | Original sections | Content |
|---|---|---|
| [01-gpu-foundations.log](01-gpu-foundations.log) | 1–21 | Baseline GPU kernels, attention, quantization, KV, snapshots and first CPU audit. |
| [02-cpu-stages.log](02-cpu-stages.log) | 22–31 | SIMD and threads, CPU INT8, growable KV, INT4 pilot, loading and consolidation audits. |
| [03-loader-qwen35-planner.log](03-loader-qwen35-planner.log) | 32–40 | Packed loader, Qwen3.5-2B/4B execution, CUDA and static V9 planner. |
| [04-granite-moe.log](04-granite-moe.log) | 41–46 | Granite 3.0 CPU/CUDA, strict parity NO-GOs and the H-Tiny feasibility pilot. |

Some raw JSON and reference vectors were recorded under ignored
`bench-results/` paths on the measuring machine. The tracked tables and
commands remain here; an ignored path is not a promise that its raw file is
available in a fresh checkout.
